# Git Commit Attribution

When creating git commits, do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any other AI/Cursor co-author trailer.

If a commit command, hook, or tool would add that trailer automatically, stop and tell the user instead of creating the commit.
